This repository is a modified fork of:
https://github.com/343534-code/ecdict-macos-dictionary

The original MDX-to-Apple-Dictionary converter, the Apple Dictionary formatting
(CSS/XSL/Info.plist), the build/packaging scripts and the semantic overlay
scaffolding come from that project and remain under the MIT License.

Modifications in this fork (2026):
- A pronunciation overlay that injects speakers into selected entries.
- Wikimedia Commons discovery with per-file license auditing (CC0,
  CC-BY-SA-3.0, CC-BY-SA-4.0, public domain).
- File-based audio playback (Resources/Audio/<id>.mp3) instead of embedding.
- Dictionary.app playback through a relative <audio> element.
- Look Up panel playback through a small local helper process.
- Part-of-speech specific recordings (e.g. record-noun / record-verb).

Audio recordings are NOT covered by the MIT License. Each recording keeps its
own license and attribution, recorded in the dictionary bundle's
Resources/ATTRIBUTION.txt and in data/audio/overlay-*/manifest.json.

This repository provides an unofficial macOS Dictionary conversion and
formatting layer. It is not endorsed by Apple Inc. or the ECDICT maintainers.
